; color: white; padding: 12px 24px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px;\">Apply Now</a>\n    </div>\n\n    <hr style=\"border: none; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\n\n    <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 12px; color: #9ca3af;\">Sent automatically by your Job Hunt AI Agent &bull; n8n workflow</p>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>",
